# discog-review-log

Before changing tooling or layout, read **`docs/tech-stack.md`** and **`docs/harness-decisions.md`**. Feature-level design lives in **`docs/superpowers/specs/`**.

## Tooling (target state)

- Package manager: **pnpm only** (Corepack + `packageManager` pin). Do not use `npm install` or yarn for dependencies.
- Quality: **Biome** (format/lint), **TypeScript strict**, **Lefthook**, **Vitest + fast-check**, **knip**, **Steiger** (FSD checks for `src/client` only), **GitHub Actions**.
- **Harness-only milestone** avoided Vite; the **application** stack adopts **Vite** per **`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-03-discog-review-log-design.md`**. When in doubt, follow that spec plus **`docs/tech-stack.md`**.

## Scope notes

- **Steiger** runs on **`src/client`** (`pnpm run steiger`). **`src/server`** is **not** modeled as FSD slices.
- Prefer matching scripts and CI order documented in **`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-03-harness-and-tooling-design.md`** once implemented.

## Edits

Keep changes minimal and aligned with existing docs. After altering pins or policy, update **`docs/harness-decisions.md`** and **`docs/tech-stack.md`** as needed.
